{"ref":"BDB, קֹ֫רַח","hw":"קֹ֫רַח","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">קֹ֫רַח</span></big><sub>37</sub>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> Κορε <strong>(baldness?)</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  Edomite name: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:5\" href=\"/Genesis.36.5\">Gn 36:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:14\" href=\"/Genesis.36.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:18\" href=\"/Genesis.36.18\">18</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:35\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.35\">1 Ch 1:35</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:16\" href=\"/Genesis.36.16\">Gn 36:16</a> (not Sam.; prob. gloss from v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:18\" href=\"/Genesis.36.18\">18</a> Di Kau Ball al.; Holz hesitates).<br><strong>2.</strong>  Levite, rebel ag. Moses, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:1\" href=\"/Numbers.16.1\">Nu 16:1</a> + 10 times <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:16\" href=\"/Numbers.16.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:17\" href=\"/Numbers.16.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:9\" href=\"/Numbers.26.9\">26:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:10\" href=\"/Numbers.26.10\">10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 27:3\" href=\"/Numbers.27.3\">27:3</a>; in geneal. lists <a data-ref=\"Exodus 6:21\" href=\"/Exodus.6.21\">Ex 6:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 6:24\" href=\"/Exodus.6.24\">24</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.7\">1 Ch 6:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:22\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.22\">22</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּן־ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:19\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.19\">9:19</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי־ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:11\" href=\"/Numbers.26.11\">Nu 26:11</a>; especially <span dir=\"rtl\">לִבְנֵי־ק׳</span> as company of ψ-collectors (or singers), in titles: <a data-ref=\"Psalms 42:1\" href=\"/Psalms.42.1\">ψ 42:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 44:1\" href=\"/Psalms.44.1\">44:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 45:1\" href=\"/Psalms.45.1\">45:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 46:1\" href=\"/Psalms.46.1\">46:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 47:1\" href=\"/Psalms.47.1\">47:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 48:1\" href=\"/Psalms.48.1\">48:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 49:1\" href=\"/Psalms.49.1\">49:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 85:1\" href=\"/Psalms.85.1\">85:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 87:1\" href=\"/Psalms.87.1\">87:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 88:1\" href=\"/Psalms.88.1\">88:1</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  a ‘son’ of Hebron, i.e. Judahite clan <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:43\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.43\">1 Ch 2:43</a> Κορεε, etc.","next":"BDB, קָרְחִי","prev":"BDB, קָרֵחַ"}